# Guestbook — PUBLIC values, committed on purpose.
#
# Both ship in the JS bundle no matter what, so there is nothing to protect: the site key is meant
# to be seen by every visitor, and the Worker URL is the endpoint the browser posts to. Committing
# them is what lets the GitHub Actions build pick them up with no workflow changes.
#
# Their matching secrets — the Turnstile SECRET key and the GitHub token — exist only as Cloudflare
# Worker secrets and are never in this repo.
VITE_GUESTBOOK_ENDPOINT=https://club-humidity-guestbook.mberenji.workers.dev
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAD_RQesWmIsw16DN
